__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.bak*

# never commit a real deployment config or its runtime state
config.json
counters.json
status.json
status_pushed.json
worker_difficulty.json
*.log
p2pool*

# The container recipe (deploy/compose.yaml) writes everything it produces under deploy/data/:
# roughly 280 GB of chain state, the engine's counters and status, and the zebrad RPC cookie — a live
# credential. None of that may ever be committed, so the whole directory is ignored rather than relying
# on the per-filename patterns above.
deploy/data/
